lerta: unknown command 'frob'
usage: lerta <command> [<argument>...]

commands:
  build         build an executable of the source
  run           build the source and run it
  fmt           check the style of the files, or fix it
  lsp           serve the language server protocol on standard input and output
  cflags        print the flags that C code of externs is compiled with
  clean         remove the cache
  license       print the license notices that go with the programs built
  dump-tokens   print the tokens of the source
  dump-ast      print the syntax tree of the source
  dump-checked  print the checked program of the source
  dump-llvm     print the LLVM IR of the source
